# The product

```json
{
  "name": "Jaipur Studio Ceramics",
  "summary": "Jaipur Studio Ceramics is an online shop for a Jaipur potter who sells mugs, bowls, planters and vases in small batches. Buyers browse pieces that are actually in stock, choose a glaze and size, and place an order without messaging the studio or paying online. The owner then collects payment by UPI, packs and ships or prepares the order for studio pickup, and uses stock and low-stock views to plan the next batch.",
  "audience": "People in India who want to buy small-batch handmade ceramics, and the single studio owner in Jaipur who makes and sells them."
}
```

# Vocabulary

```json
[
  {
    "noun": "Piece",
    "description": "A ceramic item for sale such as a mug, bowl, planter or vase, with photos, price, and glaze-and-size variants each holding their own stock quantity.",
    "belongsTo": "shopOwner"
  },
  {
    "noun": "Order",
    "description": "A buyer's placed order with their name, phone, pickup-or-courier choice, delivery address when needed, ordered variants and quantities, discount and shipping totals, payment status and fulfilment status.",
    "belongsTo": "buyer"
  },
  {
    "noun": "DiscountCode",
    "description": "A promotional code created by the owner giving a percentage or fixed amount off an Order, with an expiry date and an active or deactivated state.",
    "belongsTo": "shopOwner"
  }
]
```

